config
.
. Phase 6a lz_runtime config — the nested init that hosts Sculpt's
. Leitzentrale subsystem headlessly (Sponge OS).
.
. lz_runtime is a child of the top-level init (see run/sponge-leitzentrale.run).
. Its own config ROM is the staged "lz_runtime.config" module. It is a thin
. container with three children:
.
.   lz_relay     - report_rom that relays the leitzentrale subsystem's
.                  sandbox "state" report to lz_probe as "lz_subsys_state".
.   leitzentrale - the subsystem init (sculpt_manager + GUI stack); its
.                  config comes from the seeded model fs (child/leitzentrale,
.                  i.e. repos/sponge/src/leitzentrale/subsys.config).
.   lz_probe     - alive-check; polls lz_subsys_state for the "manager"
.                  child and logs lz-probe: PASS.
.
. The heavy lifting (model/report/font fs servers, the GUI compositor
. stack) lives INSIDE the leitzentrale subsystem (see subys.config), not
. here. lz_runtime only forwards Gui + the focus/hover ROMs (relayed by
. the top-level report_rom from the outer nitpicker) into the subsystem.
.
+ parent-provides
  + service ROM
  + service PD
  + service RM
  + service CPU
  + service LOG
  + service Timer
  + service Report
  + service Gui

+ default-route
  + any-service
    + parent
    + any-child

+ default | caps: 200 | ram: 4M

+ start lz_relay | ram: 4M
  + binary report_rom
  + provides
    + service Report
    + service ROM
  + config | verbose: no
    + policy | label: lz_probe -> lz_subsys_state | report: leitzentrale -> state

+ start leitzentrale | caps: 4000 | ram: 768M
  + binary init
  + route
    + service ROM | label: config | + parent | label: leitzentrale.config
    + service Report | label: state | + child lz_relay
    + any-service
      + parent
      + any-child

+ start lz_probe | caps: 100 | ram: 8M
  + route
    + service ROM | label: lz_subsys_state | + child lz_relay
    + service Timer                        | + parent
    + any-service
      + parent
      + any-child
-
